## Task 6 Configuring Event Boundaries in Splunk

### 1. Copy and Run the VPN Log Script
```
cp /home/ubuntu/Downloads/scripts/vpnlogs /opt/splunk/etc/apps/DataApp/bin/
cd /opt/splunk/etc/apps/DataApp/bin
./vpnlogs
```
Usually this script wont run but since running with sudo su before hand it wont be necessary to run the following to ensure execution of script allowed.
```
chmod +x vpnlogs
```
Sample output:
```
User: John Doe, Server: Server B, Action: DISCONNECT
User: Bob Johnson, Server: Server A, Action: CONNECT
User: John Doe, Server: Server D, Action: CONNECT
...
```
Each line contains three fields: User, Server, Action.

### 2. Ingest VPN Logs (inputs.conf)
Add to /opt/splunk/etc/apps/DataApp/local/inputs.conf:
```
[script:///opt/splunk/etc/apps/DataApp/bin/vpnlogs]
INDEX = main
SOURCETYPE = vpn_logs
HOST = vpn_server
INTERVAL = 5
```
Restart Splunk:
```
/opt/splunk/bin/splunk restart
```
Search and set the time range for 'All time (real-time)' :
```
index=main sourcetype=vpn_logs
```
Issue: Splunk merges all lines into one event because it cannot detect boundaries.

This should present a growing list of entries similar to this every 5 seconds.
```
9/18/26
12:23:28.000 PM	
User: Bob Johnson, Server: Server D, Action: DISCONNECT
User: Alice Smith, Server: Server B, Action: DISCONNECT
User: Bob Johnson, Server: Server E, Action: DISCONNECT
User: Bob Johnson, Server: Server D, Action: CONNECT
User: Bob Johnson, Server: Server E, Action: DISCONNECT
Show all 10 lines

    host = vpn_server
    source = /opt/splunk/etc/apps/DataApp/bin/vpnlogs
    sourcetype = vpn_logs
```

### 3. Fix Event Boundaries (props.conf)
Events always end with CONNECT or DISCONNECT, so use that pattern.

Test regex:
```
(CONNECT|DISCONNECT)
```
Create /opt/splunk/etc/apps/DataApp/local/props.conf:
```
[vpn_logs]
SHOULD_LINEMERGE = false
MUST_BREAK_AFTER = (CONNECT|DISCONNECT)
```
Restart Splunk again:
```
/opt/splunk/bin/splunk restart
```
Now each log line appears as a separate event.

```
9/18/26
12:42:01.000 PM	
User: Alice Smith, Server: Server E, Action: DISCONNECT

    host = vpn_server
    source = /opt/splunk/etc/apps/DataApp/bin/vpnlogs
    sourcetype = vpn_logs
...

9/18/26
12:42:26.000 PM	
User: Michael Brown, Server: Server E, Action: CONNECT

    host = vpn_server
    source = /opt/splunk/etc/apps/DataApp/bin/vpnlogs
    sourcetype = vpn_logs
...
```
